<title>POLAND: ARIEL 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>ARIEL 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.02 vs   0.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.03 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.06 vs   0.18 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    0.89 vs   0.97</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.88 vs   2.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.15 vs   2.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.87 vs   3.20</p>
<p> Sales		   15.02 vs  14.19</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trading company is Ariel SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
